  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Cozy_Spring/MP_CozySpring_header.webp\" width=\"1621\" height=\"521\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">一款放鬆、舒適的整合包，專注於讓你的世界感覺更加生動，並提供輕鬆愜意的遊玩體驗。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Cozy_Spring/MP_CozySpring_description.webp\" width=\"1621\" height=\"133\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Cozy Time 是一款你在漫長的一天後開啟，然後只是&hellip;深呼吸的整合包。不用趕時間，沒有壓力，只有你（也許還有幾位朋友）四處閒逛，尋找奇怪的小角落，只因覺得很舒服就停下來走走。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🌿 <strong>充滿生機的世界</strong>：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Biomes O' Plenty</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Ecologics</strong></span></a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Geophilic</strong></span></a> 為每個角落注入值得探索的新景點，而 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explorify\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Explorify</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Towns and Towers</strong></span></a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Farmers Structures</strong></span></a> 則確保你隨時都會有意外發現。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🐸 <strong>你並不孤單</strong>：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-wildernature\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>WilderNature</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critters-and-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Critters and Companions</strong></span></a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ribbits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Ribbits</strong></span></a> 將鳥類、青蛙、企鵝及各類動物帶入世界。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>傀儡也全面翻新</strong></span></a>。如果你和朋友一起玩，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-comes-alive-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>MCA Reborn</strong></span></a> 讓你定居下來並建立自己的家庭。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🎵 <strong>閉上眼睛感受一下：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">AmbientSounds 6</span></a></strong> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sound-physics-remastered\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Sound Physics Remastered</strong></span></a> 讓洞穴、森林與海灘的音效截然不同。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Better Animations Collection</strong></span></a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Visual Overhaul</strong></span></a> 則負責處理其餘的細節。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🛋️ <strong>基地裝潢，由你決定：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/another-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Another Furniture</span></a></strong>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plushables\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Plushables</strong></span></a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Armor Statues</strong></span></a> 提供超多裝飾選項。對了，搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Farmer's Delight</strong></span></a> 及其擴充模組，現在「好好吃一頓飯」可是件大事。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🌑 <strong>超越主世界</strong>：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/true-ending\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>True Ending</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Eternal Nether</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-bumblezone-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>The Bumblezone</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Deeper and Darker</strong></span></a> 讓其他維度真的值得一探。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">✔️ 這裡沒有大幅改動的 Boss 戰或硬核戰鬥模組，因為這本就不是 Cozy Time 的重點。但如果你想加，也完全沒有人會阻止你。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gb0Zv_ESXzA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>需要伺服器才能和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Cozy_Spring/MP_CozySpring_promo.webp\" width=\"1621\" height=\"203\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">想和朋友一起享受 Cozy Time 嗎？<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></span></a> 讓設定伺服器變得異常簡單，效能出色、價格合理，完全不用煩惱。使用<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">這個連結</a></strong></span>並在結帳時輸入代碼 Lupin，首月即可享 75 折優惠。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Cozy_Spring/MP_CozySpring_faq.webp\" width=\"1621\" height=\"133\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>Minecraft 一直載入中？進入世界後 FPS 卻很低？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">請務必<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmundominecraft.net%252fen%252fallocate-more-ram%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">增加 RAM 用量</a></strong>（如有需要），大多數問題都源於此。若你使用的是 CurseForge 應用程式，只需點擊設定檔選項，取消勾選「使用系統預設記憶體」並將滑桿向右移動即可（我們至少建議分配 6GB 或 6144 MB）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果發現還是不夠用，請繼續增加 RAM！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>伺服器出現錯誤怎麼辦？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">很遺憾地說，如果你自行架設伺服器，或使用我未推薦的虛擬主機，此整合包可能無法正常運作。 </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">本整合包與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></a> 完美相容，因此我強烈建議選擇該服務商。此外，透過<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>註冊並使用代碼 \"Lupin\"，即可享有 75 折優惠。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">請注意，本整合包建議至少配置 6GB 記憶體。如果玩家人數較多，建議進一步增加記憶體容量。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Cozy_Spring/MP_CozySpring_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1621\" height=\"133\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1642/650/image-curseforge.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1642/635/image14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1143\" height=\"643\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1642/622/image1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></a></p>",
